1
00:00:00,029 --> 00:00:03,529
(Leonard:)Wait, are we really going to Long Beach?

2
00:00:09,163 --> 00:00:10,203
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

3
00:00:10,372 --> 00:00:13,252
SHELDON:
Leonard? Leonard? Leonard?

4
00:00:13,417 --> 00:00:15,087
(Leonard:)Let it go, Sheldon.

5
00:00:15,252 --> 00:00:18,542
(Leonard:)The murderer was the first mate
whether it makes sense to you or not.

6
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,720
(Sheldon:)No, that's the least of our worries.

7
00:00:21,884 --> 00:00:23,714
I've been doing research on addiction...

8
00:00:23,886 --> 00:00:26,056
(Sheldon:)...both the biochemical
and behavioral aspects...

9
00:00:26,222 --> 00:00:29,432
(Sheldon:)...and I think there's a problem
with the current version of our lie.

10
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:32,560
What are you talking about?
It's fine, she bought it, it's over.

11
00:00:36,482 --> 00:00:38,692
(Sheldon:)Sadly, it's not.

12
00:00:38,859 --> 00:00:40,739
(Sheldon:)Substance abuse is a lifelong struggle.

13
00:00:40,903 --> 00:00:43,443
(Sheldon:)But beyond that,
I have realized the Leo I described...

14
00:00:43,614 --> 00:00:47,364
(Sheldon:)- ...would not have agreed to go to rehab.
- Why not?

15
00:00:47,535 --> 00:00:48,955
Because Leo's a middle child.

16
00:00:49,745 --> 00:00:53,035
There's no Leo. How can you say that?

17
00:00:56,252 --> 00:00:58,752
(Sheldon:)You didn't read the bio, did you?

